"Okay, I see you. I see all of y'all. And I got something for you right now. ${w} is coming to the main stage — and if you're not paying attention, that's on you. The lovely ${w}."
"All eyes front — and I mean all of them. ${w} is heading your way. I don't care what you were doing, what you were thinking — none of that matters in about three seconds. ${w}."
"Gentlemen, the energy in this room is about to level up. And the reason? ${w} on the main stage. Get up close and stay there. ${w}."
"I've been watching this room all night... and I know exactly what y'all need. ${w} is on her way out, and she's bringing exactly that. Main stage — ${w}."
